LPeg is Copyright (C) 2007-2023 Lua.org, PUC-Rio.

The sources under this directory are LPeg 1.1.0, unmodified, kept here so
that the port can be tested against a real third-party C extension rather
than against extensions written for the test. test.lua and re.lua are
LPeg's own suite, and expected.txt is what PUC-Lua 5.4.9 prints when it
runs it.

